---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import data from '../../data/generated/ca-5gc-sim.json';
const base=import.meta.env.BASE_URL; const href=(value:string)=>`${base}${value.replace(/^\//,'')}`;
const sourceVersion=data.source.commit?data.source.commit.slice(0,8):data.source.ref;
---
<SiteLayout title="ConnectionAgent 文档" lang="zh">
<section class="hero"><span class="eyebrow">ConnectionAgent 文档门户</span><h1>直接看清 CA 到底能做什么。</h1><p class="lede">面向整个 <code>ca-*</code> 生态的跨仓能力、API 与组件边界文档。机器契约继续由各自所属仓库维护，CA Docs 负责把它们组织成一个可读、可导航的系统视图。</p></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">已接入组件</span><h2>先从 5GC 模拟器开始</h2></div><p>当前首个完整接入的是 <code>ca-5gc-sim</code>。站点构建时会读取其权威 Schema、OpenAPI 与 HTTP 实现信息。</p></div><div class="grid"><article class="card component-card"><span class="eyebrow">ca-5gc-sim</span><h2>确定性 5GC 参考模拟器</h2><p>提供注册、PDU 会话、QoS、PFCP、用户面以及传输资源等模拟领域行为，并通过统一的 Owner API 对外暴露。</p><div class="pills"><span class="pill good">{data.counts.facts} 个 Fact semantic</span><span class="pill good">{data.counts.operations} 个 Operation semantic</span><span class="pill">{data.counts.implementationRoutes} 条实现路由</span><span class="pill">Standalone + Integrated</span></div><a class="component-link" href={href('/components/ca-5gc-sim/')}>查看 ca-5gc-sim →</a><p class="source-note">上游快照：{sourceVersion}</p></article><article class="card"><h3>为什么要做这个门户</h3><p>一个 HTTP 入口背后可能隐藏很多不同的语义能力。CA Docs 会把这些能力展开，同时说明谁负责什么，以及契约与实现是否出现漂移。</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">当前自动生成的能力清单</span><h2>不用翻代码，也能先看全貌</h2></div></div><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong>{data.counts.facts}</strong><span>Fact semantic</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>{data.counts.operations}</strong><span>Operation semantic</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>{data.counts.documentedRoutes}</strong><span>OpenAPI 路由</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>{data.counts.implementationRoutes}</strong><span>Server 实际路由</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">文档原则</span><h2>聚合权威信息，而不是复制一份新的真相</h2></div></div><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>组件所属仓库</h3><p>OpenAPI、JSON Schema 与生产实现仍由真正拥有该能力的仓库负责。</p></div><div class="card"><h3>CA Docs</h3><p>自动提取能力清单和数量，再补充人类可读的说明、边界、示例与跨仓导航。</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">后续组件</span><h2>按组件逐步扩展整个 CA 生态</h2></div><p>这里展示的是文档门户的接入目标，不会在本仓重新定义它们的机器契约。</p></div><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>ca-service-fabric</h3><p>协议中介、消息交付与 Network Observation。</p></div><div class="card"><h3>ca-runtime</h3><p>Capability、ProviderBinding、Assurance、Outcome 与 Reconcile。</p></div><div class="card"><h3>ca-provider-common / ca-provider-5gc</h3><p>身份解析与真实 5GC Provider 边界。</p></div><div class="card"><h3>ca-mcp</h3><p>面向 Agent 的准入后 Tool 能力面。</p></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>